[11:42.22]Ava: First recap point: compiler work aims to capture more useful graphs and reduce the time spent tracing or compiling them.
[11:42.22]Ava：第一点总结：编译器方面的工作旨在捕获更多有用的计算图，并缩短追踪和编译时间。
[11:51.33]Brian: Second: kernel languages and tuning help turn those graphs into efficient work on different hardware.
[11:51.33]Brian：第二点：内核语言和调优能让这些计算图在不同硬件上高效运行。
[11:58.52]Ava: Third: at scale, placement, communication, numerical quality, loading, and measurement all affect the result.
[11:58.52]Ava：第三点：在大规模场景下，任务放置、通信、数值质量、加载和测量都会影响结果。
[12:08.13]Brian: That's our tour of the work underneath PyTorch. Thanks for listening.
[12:08.13]Brian：以上就是我们对 PyTorch 底层工作的梳理。感谢收听。
